 DemoAutoConfWin connected;LF
⍝ Reproduces the WINDOW-resize (⎕WS form Size) reflow path that a real desktop
⍝ app hits - a fixed-height top BAR, a fixed-width left SIDE bar, and a filling APP area.
 EWC.CONNECTED←connected
 ⎕PW←1000
 LF←⎕UCS 10
 TOTAL←200   ⍝ rows in the virtual dataset (global; used by CBAutoConfWin)
 top←0       ⍝ 0-based offset of the first visible row (global)
 vis←10      ⍝ rows currently shown (recomputed on Configure)
 cols←3      ⍝ columns currently shown (recomputed on Configure)

⍝ Start small so a resize to large reproduces the "balloons on grow" symptom.
 'F1'eWC'Form' 'AutoConf window-resize'(0 0)(460 700)('Coord' 'Pixel')('AutoConf' 2)

⍝ Top BAR — fixed height, stretch width (Top Left Top Right). This is what a
⍝ ribbon/toolbar should do; if the base size is wrong it balloons vertically.
 'F1.BAR'eWC'SubForm'('Posn'(0 0))('Size'(70 700))('BCol'(150 180 230))('EdgeStyle' 'Border')('Attach' 'Top' 'Left' 'Top' 'Right')
 'F1.BAR.BTN'eWC'Button' 'Resize window'(8 8)(24 130)('Event' 'Select' 'CBAutoConfWin')('Attach' 'Top' 'Left' 'Top' 'Left')
 'F1.BAR.LBL'eWC'Label' ('BAR: Top Left Top Right',LF,'(fixed height, stretch width)')(8 150)(50 520)('Attach' 'Top' 'Left' 'Top' 'Right')

⍝ Left SIDE bar — fixed width, full height (Top Left Bottom Left).
 'F1.SIDE'eWC'SubForm'('Posn'(73 0))('Size'(387 170))('BCol'(230 230 200))('EdgeStyle' 'Border')('Attach' 'Top' 'Left' 'Bottom' 'Left')
 'F1.SIDE.LBL'eWC'Label' ('SIDE',LF,'Top Left Bottom Left',LF,'(fixed width)')(10 8)(80 150)('Attach' 'Top' 'Left' 'Top' 'Right')

⍝ Main APP — fills the rest (lowercase 'top left bottom right' on purpose).
 'F1.APP'eWC'SubForm'('Posn'(73 173))('Size'(387 527))('BCol'(255 255 255))('EdgeStyle' 'Border')('Attach' 'top' 'left' 'bottom' 'right')
 'F1.APP.LBL'eWC'Label' ('APP: lowercase top left bottom right — fills. GRID is "virtual":',LF,'it re-deploys cells to fit (Configure) and the bar pages ',(⍕TOTAL),' rows (Scroll).')(6 8)(32 500)('Attach' 'Top' 'Left' 'Top' 'Right')

⍝ Grid that shows only a subset of the data
 'F1.APP.GRID'eWC'Grid'('Posn'(44 8))('Size'(336 491))('Values'((⍕¨⍳vis)∘.,'/',¨⍕¨⍳cols))('CellWidths' 84)('VScroll' ¯2)('HScroll' 0)('Event' 'Configure' 'CBAutoConfWin')('Attach' 'Top' 'Left' 'Bottom' 'Right')
⍝ The app's own vertical scrollbar to the grid's right: a real Scroll with a
⍝ Scroll callback that pages the visible window through the TOTAL-row dataset.
 'F1.APP.VS'eWC'Scroll'('VScroll' ¯1)('Posn'(44 503))('Size'(336 16))('Range' TOTAL)('Thumb' vis)('Event' 'Scroll' 'CBAutoConfWin')('Attach' 'Top' 'Right' 'Bottom' 'Right')

 :If ~connected
     ⎕EX 'F1.HR'
 :EndIf
